 testUtilities;r;req;db;con;result;tbl;sel
⍝ Test utility functions: toTable, toShortTable, index
:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf
req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Utilities'

db←open':memory:'
con←connect db

⍝ ===== toTable =====
result←query con'SELECT 1 AS a, ''hello'' AS b'
r,←⊂'toTable returns text'req 0<≢toTable result

⍝ ===== toShortTable with small data =====
result←query con'SELECT * FROM range(5) t(i)'
tbl←toShortTable result
r,←⊂'toShortTable small data'req 0<≢tbl

⍝ ===== toShortTable with large data (>40 rows) =====
result←query con'SELECT * FROM range(100) t(i)'
tbl←toShortTable result
r,←⊂'toShortTable large has ellipsis'req(∨/'...'∘{(≢⍺)≤≢⍵:∨/⍺⍷⍵ ⋄ 0}¨tbl)

⍝ ===== toShortTable empty =====
result←query con'SELECT * FROM range(0) t(i)'
tbl←toShortTable result
r,←⊂'toShortTable empty'req 0<≢tbl

⍝ ===== index by column name =====
result←query con'SELECT 1 AS a, 2 AS b, 3 AS c'
sel←result index(0)('b')
r,←⊂'Index by name'req 2≡sel

⍝ ===== index by column index =====
sel←result index(0)(1)
r,←⊂'Index by number'req 2≡sel

⍝ ===== index multiple columns =====
sel←result index(0)('a' 'c')
r,←⊂'Index multiple cols'req 2=≢sel

disconnect con
close db
↑r

⍝ KSL 2.0.0
